{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_sora_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sora_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "距离",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sora_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "11745edd5a731edd6693ce875daff5ff4f07dce5753385adf2829e9d94168c00",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "发生了什么！？这些人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些人......整合运动，为什么要攻击这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈、哈......这是怎么回事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们......你们在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "住手，这是我们的社区！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啧，不想惹麻烦就让开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们......不能这么做......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "哪有什么狗屁能不能的，你们知不知道自己过的是已经烂透了的生活——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "请住手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "......谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这个声音......难道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "赶上了......哈......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "请不要对这里的居民使用暴力，他们是无辜的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "好几处的街道、商铺都被毁了，现在，甚至是无辜居民生活的公寓......住在这里的人们，他们以后该怎样生活？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "那又怎样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "这可不是我们关心的事。不闪开，那就先打趴你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我不会退让的。为别人带来快乐，鼓励大家积极地生活......这是我一直想做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "所以，在你们破坏别人的生活的时候......我要保护他们，我能够保护他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "况且，现在的我也不是一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "只会说空话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "（口哨声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "抱歉啦，空，我们晚来了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可颂，能天使，还有......德克萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "话说到这个份上，这些人却还是执迷不悟啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "既然如此，只能由正义的企鹅物流出场，咚咚咚！啪嗒啪嗒！三两下地解决掉你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "“企鹅物流”？呵，你们想来干预？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "事态紧急，来不及报告了。不过，老板可不会放着捣乱的家伙不管~这毕竟是我们做生意的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "小心，他们随时会做出危险的举动。我来拖延他们，让他们停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "好，那由我和能天使来解决这些人。可颂，你护送人群安全疏散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "好嘞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "首先打通东边路线......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "喝啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "♪~♪~♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "我怎么......动......动不了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "哼，看招——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "咳、咳啊......是那个唱歌的家伙的源石技艺......不能让她继续唱，先解决掉她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈、哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些人......停下来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "呿......想搞偷袭？那我要开过载模式了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "趁现在，快走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_wizard",
      "text": "想走？没那么容易......试试......这个——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "♪~♪~♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_wizard",
      "text": "不可能......连我的法术也没办法释放出来......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嘿嘿，空的实力还不止于此哦！空，让我变得再精神些！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "好，我知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "空小姐......真的是你？可是，你怎么可能出现在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "♪~♪~♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "就现在！冲啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们，到底是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "快离开这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "现在没有时间考虑......快走、跑起来，继续跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "♪~♪~♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "（咦？那个人是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（啊......不行，我现在的样子，不能让人看到......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "德克萨斯姐，有近卫局的人快赶到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "好。能天使，空——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我，我知道了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "趁现在撤退啦！拜拜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......那个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我应该......不，我一定见到过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "在龙门举办的第一次见面会上，第一个将信递给我的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "从某一封信之后，突然不再参加活动的女孩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我不会记错的，第一位粉丝的面孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可是，为什么......她会出现在贫民窟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "还有，她手上的源石结晶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "她......变成了感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几日后\n企鹅物流办公室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "哈......困死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "咦，空你在这里啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊......能天使，可颂。嗯，今天的练习已经结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那就好。对了，你要不要和我们出门？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "前两天帮了近卫局一些小忙，老板好像收到通知要我们去近卫局领一下“龙门热心组织”奖状。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "去近卫局门口风光地拍张合影，我看之后谁还敢拦我的车~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "不对吧，能天使姐的车还是该拦下的。嗯，不过有了照片，应该不会有人来查我的营业执照......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你的私人生意也该被查一查了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嘿嘿，小买卖，小买卖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "空你在做什么？唔，这是......信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "是的，这是......粉丝写的信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "对哦，之前你刚来的时候，企鹅物流的门口总是堆满了各种各样的礼物，信箱里也塞满了信件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "哈哈......你们先走吧，我等德克萨斯一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "行啊，那我们先出去了，车钥匙留给你们。我坐可颂的车~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "没问题，一定把能天使姐您安全及时地送到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "可别迟到啊~这可是难得的做荣誉市民的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我知道啦......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "（......应该就是这个人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "（这封信的笔迹和文字风格......我记得很清楚。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "（那时候......见面会时也在的......我的第一位粉丝......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "啊......你在等我吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "嗯？啊，抱歉，德克萨斯，我走神了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......遇到什么事了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊，没有......不是什么大事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "德克萨斯......前几天我们去贫民窟帮助的那些人......都是感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你还是很在意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "难道里面有你的熟人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我不确定，只是......大概，见过一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "如果真的是她，会出现在那里也只有这个理由了。她原本......不是生活在那里的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你看到信了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "今天上午和近卫局的通知一起送来的，似乎是前几天被我们救下的人写的感谢信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "因为有那几封感谢信在，我们才会拿到这次龙门颁发的奖状。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你手上的不是那几封信吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊，这是......以前粉丝的信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "粉丝的信？现在翻出来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "唔......没什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "真的没什么特别的事情啦，德克萨斯。我只不过是一时兴起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你要和我一起去近卫局吗，我开车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "嗯......我去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "那走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......德克萨斯，如果，只是如果。成为感染者的龙门市民，他们还有别的生活方式吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我能想到的只有两个答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "离开龙门，或是去贫民窟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......是啊，只能如此，我明明知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "德克萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我啊......之后，也能自己去送一些快递吗？我不想麻烦别人......但是，既然是企鹅物流的一员，我也想要做和大家一样的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你能保护好自己吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我，我可以做到......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "等你能向我证明这一点之后，我不会阻拦的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "嗯。谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......我总是对德克萨斯说谢谢这句话呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一周后\n龙门 贫民窟某处"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "您好，请问有人在家吗？您的包裹到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "您好，您在企鹅物流网站上下单的货物已经送到啦，麻烦签收一下~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "包裹......放在门口就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......唔，能麻烦您顺便签一下名吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我，我不是很方便出门......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "咦？您遇到什么麻烦需要帮助吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "不是的......我不是很想出来......你，你是普通快递员吧......我可是......是矿石病感染者啊......会传染给你的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "谢谢你们企鹅物流能够给我下单买东西的机会，但是我会传染给你的，快走吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "先生......先生？请冷静下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我们和感染者客户一直保持着长期稳定的联系，矿石病是不会通过简单的肢体接触进行传播的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "请您放心，企鹅物流的员工经受过专业的矿石病防护训练，您不会伤害到我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "还有，如果您需要帮助，我们也可以及时提供服务，我们负责过一些专业医药公司的合作项目......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "先生，您还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你......真的不怕我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "当然，企鹅物流将竭诚为每一位客户提供热情的服务！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......还是算了。就放在门口吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "对了，下次能够拜托你们帮我送信到上城区吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "当然没问题啦！企鹅物流同样具备信件快递服务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "唉......好吧。我需要告诉一些人我的近况，如果他们愿意给我回信的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......先生，如果您不介意的话，我可以帮您联系......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "不，还是算了。离我远点就行。我现在脑子还很乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "就这样吧，下次还是麻烦你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......不是她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "今天也没有遇到......说不定已经离开龙门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "也可能是我看错了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可是，寄给企鹅物流的感谢信，和曾经作为粉丝寄给我的信件笔迹是一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "没有使用详细的地址，也没有留下名字。只是简简单单的一封感谢信。可是我知道，那就是你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......我想见到你。至少，能见一面......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你会想要见到我吗？我该......在现在见你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "明明我有想说的话，希望能直接告诉你。一定要振作起来，一定要充满希望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......明天，明天也来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半个月后\n龙门贫民窟 某一次送货途中"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "请问有人在家吗？您的包裹到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "您好，您在企鹅物流网站上下单的货物已经送到啦，麻烦签收一下~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "请问有人在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "（咬牙）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "唔，客人填的送货时间是现在啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "您好，真的没有人在家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "（颤抖）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......是她的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "（应该是这间没错啊......不在家吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "放在门口之后发送物流信息确认......好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空下意识地将手放在口袋边上。她缓缓地将信封拿在手上。\n在满是反复折叠痕迹的旧信封上，写着“致空小姐”的标题。\n信封内装着反复比对过的信件，和空已经熟记于心的文字。\n那些对她感谢，让她放心，却仍透露出怀念的文字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "怎么都找不到，明明之前还在这附近见到过你......你现在真的不住在这里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我还是......想见到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房中的人攥紧了手。\n然而，门还是没有打开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......不过，没关系，总会再遇见的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "呼，好了，下一个包裹是送到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "......应该，走了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（弯腰）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（捡起包裹）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......谢谢你，空小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看来，那封信也收到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......真想再见你一面啊。但是现在的我，我的身体，我的病......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等我能够重新面对自己的时候，你一定也会很欣慰吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......一定会再去你的演唱会，走进你的见面会现场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "总有一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
